Z||000000||SCFIERO||12-12-2000||05:50 PM||||Can anyone steer me into the right direction of taking out the dash of an 86 GT?<BR>Thanks||||reg||5
Z||000001||rogergarrison||12-12-2000||05:54 PM||||haynes gives you step by step. havent done it, but hear its not that big a deal.||||reg||1
