Z||000003||RossT||12-14-2000||12:42 AM||||I did my first one this past summer.  The first one takes some time, but once you learn how, the second is much faster!!||||reg||1
Z||000004||Monkeyman||12-14-2000||05:01 PM||||Piece of cake.  1st remove the covers for the radio/HVAC controls (requires removal of the shifter console 1st).  Then remove the two screws/bolts under the bottom corners of the dash.  Then remove the speakers.  In the well (but not under the speakers) where the speakers go, you'll find two screws on each side.  Remove those, too.  It's easier if you remove the gauge pod, but not absolutely necessary.  BTW, you'll also need to remove the aux. gauges.  Everything will be simple once you get started.||||reg||1
